+/*
+ * MT6797 (Helio X20) M4U larb/port IDs.
+ *
+ * Transcribed mechanically from the vendor 3.18 kernel table
+ * drivers/misc/mediatek/m4u/mt6797/m4u_platform.h (gM4uPort[]), which
+ * carries the larb id and larb-local port number for every master.
+ * Only larb0 (display/MDP) has a consumer in this tree today; the rest
+ * are transcribed so that an incomplete header cannot become a trap
+ * later.
+ *
+ * Note larb5 is the SECOND display path (DISP_OVL1/RDMA1), not larb0 --
+ * mt6797.dtsi currently points those nodes at larb0, which is wrong and
+ * only harmless because they are status="disabled".
